WEBVTT

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:19.240
Hop, step, jump.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.140
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:22.950
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:24.400
Who I wanna be. 

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:35.650
They call me calm, strong, and cool. 

00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:40.000
Everyone says I'm popular.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.410
But the truth is, I'm not like that at all. 

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:46.620
I'm just an ordinary girl! 

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:50.730
I wish I could just get rid 

00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:54.510
of all this pressure and be myself. 

00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:58.350
But they'd all say it's out of character. 

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:02.760
Unlock my heart! 

00:01:03.570 --> 00:01:08.110
Just be who you wanna be. 

00:01:08.110 --> 00:01:10.960
Your Guardian Characters are with you. 

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:15.210
Just do it the way you wanna do it. 

00:01:15.210 --> 00:01:18.280
It'll be okay, really! 

00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:23.190
Just be who you wanna be. 

00:01:23.190 --> 00:01:25.960
Having only one style would be way too boring. 

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:30.220
Just do it the way you wanna do it. 

00:01:30.220 --> 00:01:34.490
You can do anything! 

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:36.110
I know that...

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:37.950
Hop, step, jump.

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:39.840
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:41.710
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:01:41.710 --> 00:01:43.020
...is who I wanna be. 

00:01:46.140 --> 00:01:49.570
We managed to finish cleaning up all the documents somehow.

00:01:49.570 --> 00:01:51.890
It's always really bad.

00:01:51.890 --> 00:01:54.100
I'm tired.

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:57.630
The Guardians' work can be kind of boring, but it's also really hectic, huh?

00:01:57.630 --> 00:02:00.460
Yes, though you stuck with us through it all. Sorry about that.

00:02:00.460 --> 00:02:02.100
Yeah, since you're the Joker.

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:04.600
No, I'm not really doing anything special.

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:08.800
Oh, but the tea you made is lovely.

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:10.350
Snacks.

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:12.790
I want to eat snacks!

00:02:12.790 --> 00:02:15.860
Sorry, I didn't prepare any for today.

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:17.470
Stay with us, Yaya!

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:22.850
Then let's go get some ice cream. There's a really great place near my house.

00:02:22.850 --> 00:02:26.190
Sorry, I have dance practice today.

00:02:26.190 --> 00:02:28.020
I've got soccer practice.

00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:29.910
I have something I need to do, too.

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:31.600
See you!

00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:37.270
I, uh, guess I should get going, too.

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:39.760
Let's go together!

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:41.860
Amu-chi, you have time, right?

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:48.370
Character Transformation! Amulet Spade!

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:48.370
Episode 6

00:02:48.370 --> 00:02:51.250
Hitsujita Mimiko's Ballet School

00:02:57.060 --> 00:03:00.030
Wow, everyone's really flexible.

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:01.310
Amu-chi!

00:03:01.310 --> 00:03:03.390
Are you watching?

00:03:03.390 --> 00:03:05.070
I am. I am.

00:03:05.070 --> 00:03:06.650
Holy... That's <i>too</i> flexible!

00:03:06.650 --> 00:03:08.520
This is a piece of cake!

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:10.310
Do you even have bones in there?

00:03:10.970 --> 00:03:14.040
Weren't we supposed to be going home and stopping to get ice cream?

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:18.100
Sorry about that, I have a recital coming up, so I can't skip practice.

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:19.900
Wait here just for a bit.

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:23.980
Ballet is fun!

00:03:23.980 --> 00:03:26.720
It's so girly!

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:29.850
It's like art!

00:03:30.430 --> 00:03:34.860
Hi, my little fairies! How are you doing today?

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:36.430
That's some teacher!

00:03:37.950 --> 00:03:40.050
How is the lesson going?

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:41.750
I'm working hard!

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:47.370
Um...

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:48.290
Stand!

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:49.000
O-Okay!

00:03:55.890 --> 00:03:59.100
You have long legs and good posture.

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:01.890
You're suited for ballet! Try dancing a bit!

00:04:02.570 --> 00:04:05.130
Isn't that great, Amu-chi? Give it a shot!

00:04:05.130 --> 00:04:06.350
That would be impossible!

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:08.950
Go, Amu-chan!

00:04:12.290 --> 00:04:14.190
Ran!

00:04:18.470 --> 00:04:19.820
Someone...

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:21.770
Stop me!

00:04:24.140 --> 00:04:27.520
No! Stop!

00:04:30.510 --> 00:04:33.850
Your dancing was unexpectedly good.

00:04:33.850 --> 00:04:36.100
Amu-chi, are you okay?

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:37.640
I'm not.

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:41.720
Ran!

00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:43.240
I guess I overdid it.

00:04:43.240 --> 00:04:44.430
I'll flush you down the toilet!

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:46.680
I'm sorry.

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:50.690
Could you move out of the way, flower fairy #2?

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:53.360
The prima must begin her practice.

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:54.770
Sorry, Mai-ti.

00:04:57.470 --> 00:04:59.710
It was really good.

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:00.870
Could I ask you to move?

00:05:00.870 --> 00:05:02.180
Sorry.

00:05:02.180 --> 00:05:04.730
What's with her? She gives me a bad vibe.

00:05:04.730 --> 00:05:06.840
Her name is Himekawa Maika-chan.

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:10.680
She's been called a prodigy ever since she started going here.

00:05:10.680 --> 00:05:14.600
Her mom was a famous ballerina a long time ago.

00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:19.850
Okay, my little fairies, let's begin a full rehearsal!

00:05:19.850 --> 00:05:24.770
We'll start with the first act, with the flower fairies dancing in their groups, all right?

00:05:22.870 --> 00:05:24.770
Amu-chi, watch me!

00:05:24.770 --> 00:05:25.780
Sure, sure.

00:05:37.350 --> 00:05:39.670
Yaya, you're pretty good.

00:05:39.670 --> 00:05:42.940
No, she's not. She's not raising her legs enough.

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:44.450
You don't have to be so critical.

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:47.570
Allow me to show you

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:48.910
how the prima dances.

00:05:49.410 --> 00:05:51.890
It's time for the prima!

00:06:03.970 --> 00:06:06.840
She might be a jerk, but she might be the best one.

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:08.410
There's that stubborn side again.

00:06:08.410 --> 00:06:10.560
You're not very straightforward, are you?

00:06:10.560 --> 00:06:12.440
Wow.

00:06:25.240 --> 00:06:26.520
Maika-san!

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:28.540
Are you okay, Mai-ti?

00:06:28.540 --> 00:06:30.310
This is nothing.

00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:35.600
This is a pretty bad sprain.

00:06:35.600 --> 00:06:39.160
Looking at this, there's no way you'll be able to dance in next week's recital.

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:40.560
I can do it!

00:06:40.560 --> 00:06:45.140
If you strain it, it'll get worse. You can't push yourself.

00:06:45.140 --> 00:06:47.970
We'll have to use an understudy.

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:49.550
You must be joking.

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:54.410
Yuiki Yaya-san,  you will take her place as prima.

00:06:54.410 --> 00:06:55.720
M-Me?

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:59.180
Now, let's carry on.

00:06:59.180 --> 00:07:02.390
Maika-san, wait here until your mother comes to pick you up.

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:04.310
Okay.

00:07:17.520 --> 00:07:19.520
Yaya's the prima?

00:07:20.770 --> 00:07:23.500
You always get parts like spirit of the tree, or rock.

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:25.330
Well, I'm the understudy, so I have no choice.

00:07:25.330 --> 00:07:27.270
And besides, rocks don't have parts!

00:07:27.270 --> 00:07:29.260
I was surprised.

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:32.210
Sure, your dancing's not the best, but...

00:07:32.210 --> 00:07:33.930
Jeez. You too, Amu-chi?!

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:36.320
Ballet is awesome.

00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:37.350
It is.

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:40.430
You guys have been at this since yesterday.

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:43.130
We're improving!

00:07:43.130 --> 00:07:46.530
I will not be outdone, especially not at dance.

00:07:46.530 --> 00:07:48.520
That's a bit different.

00:07:49.390 --> 00:07:51.470
I am capable of at least that much.

00:07:58.650 --> 00:08:00.250
What are you drawing, Miki?

00:08:02.600 --> 00:08:04.470
Is that Himekawa-san?

00:08:04.470 --> 00:08:07.470
She was really pretty.

00:08:07.470 --> 00:08:08.730
She was.

00:08:08.730 --> 00:08:11.230
She'll dance again, right?

00:08:11.230 --> 00:08:12.020
Yeah.

00:08:12.020 --> 00:08:16.810
But how disappointing for her, to become injured right after getting the main part.

00:08:21.420 --> 00:08:22.690
Yeah.

00:08:22.690 --> 00:08:25.470
I'm sure she'll be just fine.

00:08:25.470 --> 00:08:28.960
"My dream is to be the prima in a world-class ballet company!"

00:08:28.960 --> 00:08:30.600
"A recital of this level is mere child's play."

00:08:30.600 --> 00:08:32.970
She'll say something like that.

00:08:32.970 --> 00:08:34.640
She seems pretty strict.

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:37.090
I wonder about that.

00:08:41.660 --> 00:08:47.080
Central General Hospital

00:08:54.920 --> 00:08:57.270
I wanted to be the prima.

00:08:57.270 --> 00:08:59.890
I worked so hard for it.

00:09:00.470 --> 00:09:01.900
But none of it

00:09:02.660 --> 00:09:04.770
matters now.

00:09:10.170 --> 00:09:11.890
I found you.

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:16.000
Your heart's egg is completely exposed.

00:09:33.720 --> 00:09:35.840
Amu-chan looks kind of down.

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:38.560
Where are we going?

00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:41.390
I wonder if she's all right.

00:09:44.120 --> 00:09:48.520
Are dreams so easy to break, or so hard to fulfill?

00:09:53.910 --> 00:09:57.070
Somehow, we ended up here.

00:09:57.070 --> 00:09:59.680
Maybe we'll be able to see those stars again!

00:10:11.390 --> 00:10:12.580
Something smells good.

00:10:20.030 --> 00:10:22.470
It's rare for me to have guests.

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:25.920
Are you the Caretaker of this planetarium?

00:10:25.920 --> 00:10:28.890
That's right, although it's just a side job.

00:10:28.890 --> 00:10:32.040
I do the maintenance, but I sometimes come just to have a look.

00:10:32.850 --> 00:10:35.010
The tea has a gentle scent.

00:10:35.010 --> 00:10:37.920
He reminds me of Tadase for some reason.

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:44.160
This is a peculiar place.

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:50.480
Though it has been forgotten by most everyone, those who have doubts or are lost can still find it.

00:10:50.480 --> 00:10:52.640
Perhaps I am one of those people myself.

00:10:52.640 --> 00:10:57.040
Whenever I'm worried about how to finish a novel, I come here to watch the stars.

00:10:57.040 --> 00:10:59.640
When I do that, good ideas come to me.

00:10:59.640 --> 00:11:01.330
Novels?

00:11:01.330 --> 00:11:03.160
So you're an author?

00:11:03.160 --> 00:11:04.770
Just a beginner who hasn't sold any copies.

00:11:04.770 --> 00:11:06.640
I'm a novice.

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:09.350
But it's my dream to become a full-fledged author someday.

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:12.430
You can have dreams even though you're a grown-up?

00:11:12.430 --> 00:11:13.360
Of course.

00:11:15.280 --> 00:11:16.410
Dreams...

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:20.380
So tell me, what are you struggling with?

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:27.850
I met an adult who told me that very few people are able to make their dreams come true.

00:11:27.850 --> 00:11:31.930
So I've been wondering if dreams really are that fragile or hard to realize.

00:11:33.720 --> 00:11:36.710
Let me tell you a secret about storytelling.

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:42.170
Both Cinderella and Snow White, at the beginning of their respective tales, were lacking something.

00:11:42.170 --> 00:11:46.060
It was only on the last page that they were able to live happily ever after with their princes.

00:11:46.060 --> 00:11:50.680
If the princesses had everything from the beginning, then there would be no story.

00:11:51.830 --> 00:11:56.520
So any girl who is imperfect or incomplete can become the main character.

00:11:57.950 --> 00:11:59.640
The main

00:11:59.640 --> 00:12:00.820
character?

00:12:02.670 --> 00:12:03.810
Even me?

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:17.230
An egg will hatch.

00:12:17.890 --> 00:12:20.910
The egg of a gifted ballerina.

00:12:20.910 --> 00:12:22.890
It might be the Embryo.

00:12:22.890 --> 00:12:27.670
But if it's not, I'll leave the clean-up to you.

00:12:29.950 --> 00:12:31.110
What's wrong?

00:12:31.110 --> 00:12:32.880
You have a problem with that?

00:12:32.880 --> 00:12:34.060
Not really.

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:38.920
See you later.

00:12:43.660 --> 00:12:45.850
Man, I hate that guy-nya.

00:13:01.700 --> 00:13:02.850
What?

00:13:02.850 --> 00:13:05.430
You're going to watch all day?

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:06.030
Yeah.

00:13:06.030 --> 00:13:07.760
Yay!

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:10.480
To be honest, I'm just really worried about that girl.

00:13:10.480 --> 00:13:12.230
Check this out, Amu-chi.

00:13:12.230 --> 00:13:15.800
I'll be wearing this during rehearsal today!

00:13:15.800 --> 00:13:19.830
Sorry to make you all wait.

00:13:19.830 --> 00:13:23.000
Orie-san, did you fix that one-piece that was worn out?

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:24.960
Sure did. Hold on.

00:13:24.960 --> 00:13:26.250
Who is that?

00:13:26.250 --> 00:13:29.060
Mai-ti's mom. Her name's Orie-san.

00:13:29.060 --> 00:13:32.890
She's been making our costumes.

00:13:32.890 --> 00:13:35.180
So you're the new prima?

00:13:35.180 --> 00:13:36.580
Y-Yes!

00:13:37.240 --> 00:13:40.850
Could you try on the prima's next costume, then?

00:13:42.640 --> 00:13:46.520
I made it for Maika, so I might have to alter the size a bit.

00:13:46.520 --> 00:13:48.250
Okay!

00:13:56.820 --> 00:13:58.380
She's pretty.

00:13:58.380 --> 00:14:01.300
It's amazing that she could make that.

00:14:02.310 --> 00:14:04.100
Oh, Maika.

00:14:04.100 --> 00:14:05.620
Mom.

00:14:06.810 --> 00:14:08.780
Are you going to watch practice?

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:11.520
I can wait, so we can go home together.

00:14:11.520 --> 00:14:12.830
I'll have the car ready.

00:14:14.150 --> 00:14:15.530
I can get home by myself.

00:14:15.530 --> 00:14:16.770
Go without me.

00:14:18.190 --> 00:14:19.270
Are you sure?

00:14:24.280 --> 00:14:26.520
Spin, spin, spin.

00:14:26.520 --> 00:14:27.710
Ta-da!

00:14:28.700 --> 00:14:31.320
Why am I dressed up like this, too?

00:14:31.320 --> 00:14:33.390
Amu-chan, you're so cute!

00:14:33.390 --> 00:14:34.720
Yeah, not bad.

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:36.930
It looks good on you, Amu-chi!

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:38.930
Y-You think?

00:14:38.930 --> 00:14:39.810
Yeah.

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:44.180
All right, my little fairies, let's begin dress rehearsal!

00:14:56.540 --> 00:14:59.460
No, Yaya-san! You're supposed to do a tour there!  

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:00.690
Right!

00:15:00.690 --> 00:15:03.100
Hasn't her personality totally changed?

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:10.140
Yaya-san, pull yourself together!

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:11.680
Right!

00:15:17.490 --> 00:15:19.510
Yaya's trying her best.

00:15:23.870 --> 00:15:26.890
Fairy Yaya, you need more practice.

00:15:26.890 --> 00:15:30.390
Maika-san, would you help Yaya with her choreography for a spell?

00:15:30.880 --> 00:15:31.700
Sure.

00:15:37.840 --> 00:15:40.990
Why is Amu-chan wearing a costume, too?

00:15:40.990 --> 00:15:43.570
Maybe she wondered what it was like.

00:15:43.570 --> 00:15:44.850
I can hear you two!

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:46.780
Wait!

00:15:47.610 --> 00:15:51.010
You know, there will be other recitals.

00:15:51.010 --> 00:15:52.860
So...

00:15:53.560 --> 00:15:55.250
Cheer up!

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:58.070
Recitals don't matter.

00:15:58.070 --> 00:16:01.310
My mom left the ballet due to an injury.

00:16:02.280 --> 00:16:04.500
In a mere second,

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:07.070
because of something trivial, she lost all the fame she'd worked for, everything.

00:16:08.060 --> 00:16:10.310
She did not lose everything!

00:16:11.120 --> 00:16:15.390
Orie-san is pretty, and the costumes she made are really nice!

00:16:15.390 --> 00:16:18.270
What do you know about anything?!

00:16:18.270 --> 00:16:22.480
My mom danced more beautifully than any ballerina!

00:16:22.480 --> 00:16:26.340
But no matter how hard you try,

00:16:26.340 --> 00:16:28.280
you can lose it all in an instant!

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:47.060
There's an X on Mai-ti's egg!

00:16:50.250 --> 00:16:54.060
Well rats, it's not the Embryo again.

00:16:55.110 --> 00:16:59.050
I guess I'll leave the rest to you, Black Cat-kun.

00:17:04.680 --> 00:17:08.430
Un, deux, trois!

00:17:12.720 --> 00:17:14.880
An X Character hatched!

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:18.170
Hold on, Mai-ti, we'll save you!

00:17:18.170 --> 00:17:19.780
Let's go, Pepe-chan!

00:17:19.780 --> 00:17:20.890
Right-dechu!

00:17:20.890 --> 00:17:25.060
Pretty Cutie Love Baby!

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:30.110
Gigantic Rattle Attack!

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:39.340
It hurts!

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:39.330
She's crying?!

00:17:39.340 --> 00:17:40.810
Because she has a baby personality?!

00:17:44.680 --> 00:17:45.750
It's worthless.

00:17:46.640 --> 00:17:48.970
There's no point in trying.

00:17:50.140 --> 00:17:51.400
No!

00:17:51.400 --> 00:17:52.570
Amu-chan.

00:17:52.570 --> 00:17:53.140
Yeah.

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:55.270
My heart:

00:17:55.270 --> 00:17:56.640
Unlock!

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:38.020
Character Transformation: Amulet Spade!

00:18:39.140 --> 00:18:41.280
I've Character Transformed with Miki?

00:18:41.280 --> 00:18:42.720
Way to go, Miki!

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:44.270
That's cool!

00:18:49.390 --> 00:18:51.680
Hey, that was dangerous!

00:18:57.890 --> 00:18:59.670
I can't get close to it like this.

00:18:59.670 --> 00:19:01.250
Leave it to me!

00:19:05.130 --> 00:19:06.500
Nice one, Miki!

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:08.170
Use this!

00:19:08.170 --> 00:19:08.840
Yeah.

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:13.270
Colorful canvas!

00:19:14.680 --> 00:19:16.020
I did it!

00:19:18.560 --> 00:19:20.520
It was all useless.

00:19:21.470 --> 00:19:26.680
I lost everything I worked so hard for all at once, just like my mom.

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:27.330
I can't dance anymore.

00:19:27.330 --> 00:19:27.890
It's useless.

00:19:27.890 --> 00:19:29.080
I'm just like my mom.

00:19:33.280 --> 00:19:34.890
Stop being a crybaby!

00:19:36.920 --> 00:19:39.450
Who cares if you messed up a bit?

00:19:39.450 --> 00:19:43.200
Don't go calling all the time your mom spent useless!

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:46.020
You were really cool when you were dancing.

00:19:46.020 --> 00:19:49.560
Even when Yaya fell, she didn't cry about it, she just got back up!

00:19:49.560 --> 00:19:52.430
Both of you are awesome primas!

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:57.600
Negative Heart:

00:19:58.850 --> 00:20:00.510
Lock On!

00:20:05.520 --> 00:20:07.850
Open Heart!

00:20:20.350 --> 00:20:22.520
Merci, Amu-chan.

00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:24.970
So you're Mai-ti's Guardian Character?

00:20:25.830 --> 00:20:29.950
The next time I'm born, I'll be dancing with my own toe shoes.

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:32.040
But for now, I'm still...

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:33.620
Until we meet again!

00:20:41.860 --> 00:20:43.620
Amu-chan, we need you.

00:20:45.630 --> 00:20:47.340
What should we do?

00:20:47.340 --> 00:20:48.930
She's still crying?

00:20:48.930 --> 00:20:51.610
Yaya, want to get some ice cream?

00:20:51.610 --> 00:20:53.690
Only if you treat me!

00:20:53.690 --> 00:20:55.430
Why do I have to?

00:20:55.430 --> 00:20:58.810
She cleansed the X Egg again-nya.

00:20:58.810 --> 00:21:03.770
Well, I guess it's lucky for us that we didn't have to clean up-nya.

00:21:03.770 --> 00:21:05.720
Guess so.

00:21:06.330 --> 00:21:09.910
Recital     Hitsujita Mimiko

00:21:18.730 --> 00:21:20.230
Yaya's pretty.

00:21:20.230 --> 00:21:21.580
She is.

00:21:22.690 --> 00:21:25.190
I never thought we'd see the day where Yaya was the prima.

00:21:25.190 --> 00:21:27.340
That's an exaggeration, Soma-kun.

00:21:27.340 --> 00:21:30.180
That costume is nice.

00:21:30.180 --> 00:21:31.560
Thanks.

00:21:40.610 --> 00:21:42.770
My little fairies were splendid!

00:21:42.770 --> 00:21:45.150
I'm tired.

00:21:45.870 --> 00:21:46.770
Good job.

00:21:46.770 --> 00:21:48.280
Mai-ti!

00:21:48.280 --> 00:21:50.910
You made seven errors, and you stumbled twice.

00:21:51.770 --> 00:21:54.770
But it was a really nice performance.

00:21:55.410 --> 00:21:57.880
Mai-ti!

00:21:57.880 --> 00:21:59.520
How's your ankle?

00:21:59.520 --> 00:22:02.800
Something like this will heal in no time,

00:22:03.710 --> 00:22:05.520
and then I'll dance again.

00:22:05.520 --> 00:22:09.820
That was amazing. Your best so far.

00:22:09.820 --> 00:22:13.680
I'll definitely become a prima, like my mom.

00:22:15.430 --> 00:22:16.210
Yeah.

00:22:34.890 --> 00:22:40.990
As long as I exist, even when I'm a pile of dust, 

00:22:40.990 --> 00:22:47.390
I'll keep cheering "you can do it, you can do it" out loud! 

00:22:47.390 --> 00:22:48.210
(You can do it!)

00:22:48.210 --> 00:22:54.370
I'll never stop as long as I live,  

00:22:54.370 --> 00:23:00.720
so I'll sing my never-ending song. 

00:23:01.620 --> 00:23:05.230
I'll press forward down my path. 

00:23:05.230 --> 00:23:08.750
Even random characters have their merits. 

00:23:08.750 --> 00:23:13.590
You might be worthless, but I'll still love you, 

00:23:13.590 --> 00:23:15.060
my darling.

00:23:15.050 --> 00:23:18.850
You idiot! My true self... 

00:23:18.850 --> 00:23:21.810
Just say what's on your mind. 

00:23:21.810 --> 00:23:25.240
You're sticking out a little. 

00:23:25.240 --> 00:23:28.510
You're coming closer to my dream. 

00:23:28.510 --> 00:23:32.290
You jerk! My true self... 

00:23:32.290 --> 00:23:36.540
Please come out, don't hide. 

00:23:36.540 --> 00:23:41.480
Oh yeah! Right now! 

00:23:50.080 --> 00:23:54.300
The Embryo is a magical egg which can grant any wish.

00:23:54.300 --> 00:23:56.060
It'll grant any wish.

00:23:56.060 --> 00:23:57.520
It's a magical egg?

00:23:57.520 --> 00:23:58.460
Benbenbio?

00:23:58.460 --> 00:23:59.520
No!

00:23:59.520 --> 00:24:00.930
The Embryo!

00:24:00.930 --> 00:24:02.970
Where would you find it?

00:24:02.970 --> 00:24:04.180
How would I know?

00:24:04.180 --> 00:24:06.800
But we'll finally find it!

00:24:06.800 --> 00:24:08.710
Ami-chan will!

00:24:08.710 --> 00:24:09.310
No way!

00:24:09.310 --> 00:24:10.570
Seriously?

00:24:10.570 --> 00:24:12.150
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:12.150 --> 00:24:13.420
The Small Egg!

00:24:13.420 --> 00:24:14.520
We'll finally find...

00:24:14.520 --> 00:24:15.310
The legendary...

00:24:15.310 --> 00:24:15.980
Embryo!

00:24:15.980 --> 00:24:17.170
Benbenbio!

00:24:17.170 --> 00:24:18.630
That's not it!
